---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

const link =
  "text-fg underline decoration-fg-faint underline-offset-2 transition-colors hover:decoration-fg";
---

<Layout title="Refund Policy | coolLabs">
  <h1 class="px-4 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-balance text-fg md:text-5xl">
    Refund policy<span class="text-warning">.</span>
  </h1>
  <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-2xl px-4 text-base text-pretty text-fg-dim">
    Our commitment to your satisfaction.
  </p>

  <article
    class="mx-auto mt-16 max-w-3xl px-4 pb-16 text-left text-[15px] leading-7 text-fg-dim
    [&_h2]:mt-12 [&_h2]:text-xl [&_h2]:font-semibold [&_h2]:tracking-tight [&_h2]:text-fg
    [&_p]:mt-3 [&_strong]:font-medium [&_strong]:text-fg
    [&_ul]:mt-3 [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:space-y-1.5 [&_ul]:pl-5
    [&_ol]:mt-3 [&_ol]:list-decimal [&_ol]:space-y-1.5 [&_ol]:pl-5 [&_li]:marker:text-fg-faint"
  >
      <p class="!mt-0 mb-6 border-b border-hairline pb-6 text-xs text-fg-faint">
        Effective Date: July 3, 2023
      </p>
      <p>
        At coolLabs Solutions Kft. ("we", "us", or "our"), we strive to ensure
        your satisfaction with our services. If you are not fully satisfied with
        your purchase, we offer a 30-day refund policy under the following
        terms:
      </p>
      <p>
        Our products may include links to external sites not operated by us.
        Please be aware that we have no control over their content or privacy
        practices, and this policy does not apply to them.
      </p>

      <h2>Eligibility</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Timeframe</strong>: Refund requests must
          be submitted within 30 calendar days from the date of purchase.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Services Covered</strong>: This policy
          applies to all paid Coollabs services, including subscriptions to
          Coolify, Fonts, or other hosted solutions.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Usage</strong>: Refunds are eligible for
          accounts without any usage limitation.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Non-eligible cases</h2>
      <p>Refunds will not be granted for:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          Violations of our Terms of Service (e.g., misuse of resources).
        </li>
        <li>
          Requests submitted after the 30-day period.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Refund process</h2>
      <ol>
        <li>
          <strong>Submit a Request</strong>: Contact our
          support team at hi [(at]) coollabs.io with your account details and
          reason for the refund request.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Review</strong>: We will review your
          request within 5 business days to confirm eligibility.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Processing</strong>: Approved refunds
          will be processed to the original payment method within 10 business
          days. Refunds will exclude any transaction fees charged by payment
          processors.
        </li>
      </ol>

      <h2>Contact us</h2>
      <p>Questions or want to request a refund? Reach out to us:</p>
      <ul class="!list-none !pl-0">
        <li>
          <strong>Email</strong>: hi [(at])
          coollabs.io
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>More Info</strong>:
          <a
            href="https://coolify.io/docs/contact"
            class={link}>https://coolify.io/docs/contact</a
          >
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        coolLabs reserves the right to modify this refund policy at any time.
        Changes will be posted on this page with an updated effective date.
      </p>
  </article>
</Layout>
